aidabd:col-treatment_with_small_molecules_not_associated_to_b-pay_attention_sm a csvw:Column ;
    csvw:name "pay_attention_sm" ;
    csvw:title "PAY ATTENTION PLEASE In the form \"Past and current treatments\" you did not select Small Molecules (smDMARDs) among treatments taken by the patient. We concluded that the patient did never try smDMARDs as treatment approach. Please, if so, save and go to the next form, otherwise go back to the form \"Past and current treatments\" and correct. Then, come back here to collect data on treatment with smDMARDs"@en ;
    csvw:datatype "string" ;
    dct:description "PAY ATTENTION PLEASE In the form \"Past and current treatments\" you did not select Small Molecules (smDMARDs) among treatments taken by the patient. We concluded that the patient did never try smDMARDs as treatment approach. Please, if so, save and go to the next form, otherwise go back to the form \"Past and current treatments\" and correct. Then, come back here to collect data on treatment with smDMARDs"@en .

