aidabd:col-treatment_with_biologic_agents_the_retrospective_p-pay_attention7 a csvw:Column ;
    csvw:name "pay_attention7" ;
    csvw:title "PAY ATTENTION PLEASE In the form \"Past and current treatments\" you did not select any biologic agent among treatments taken by the patient. We concluded that the patient did never try biologics as treatment approach. Please, if so, save and go to the next form, otherwise go back to the form \"Past and current treatments\" and correct. Then, come back here to collect data on treatment with biologic agents"@en ;
    csvw:datatype "string" ;
    dct:description "PAY ATTENTION PLEASE In the form \"Past and current treatments\" you did not select any biologic agent among treatments taken by the patient. We concluded that the patient did never try biologics as treatment approach. Please, if so, save and go to the next form, otherwise go back to the form \"Past and current treatments\" and correct. Then, come back here to collect data on treatment with biologic agents"@en .

aidabd:col-treatment_with_biologic_agents_the_retrospective_p-biologic_used a csvw:Column ;
    csvw:name "biologic_used" ;
    csvw:title "Which biologic agent used in this patient are you going to describe? Note that you should fill out as many forms for how many biologicals this patient has been admnistered with"@en ;
    csvw:datatype "integer" ;
    dct:description "Which biologic agent used in this patient are you going to describe? Note that you should fill out as many forms for how many biologicals this patient has been admnistered with"@en .

